        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "block_label": "text",
      "block_content": "51. What does the passage say about the statement “beauty is in the eye of the beholder”?\nA) It has hardly ever been disputed. C) Many people have found it absurd.\nB) It can be interpreted aesthetically. D) People have long been misled by it.",
      "block_bbox": [
        68,
        546,
        945,
        633
      ],
      "block_id": 5,
      "block_order": 6,
      "group_id": 5,
      "block_polygon_points": [
