    },
    {
      "block_label": "text",
      "block_content": "52. What does a recent study exploring aesthetic taste show?\nA) Aesthetic tastes tend to differ from person to person.\nB) Natural beauty is rarely surpassed by artificial beauty.\nC) There is less consensus on objects shaped by human craft.\nD) There is general agreement on what is pleasing to the eye.",
      "block_bbox": [
        69,
        638,
        612,
        790
      ],
      "block_id": 6,
      "block_order": 7,
      "group_id": 6,
      "block_polygon_points": [
