          69.0,
          790.0
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "block_label": "text",
      "block_content": "53. Why do people differ in their aesthetic appraisal of artifacts?\nA) They come out in a great variety of designs.\nB) They lead to varying behavioral consequences.\nC) They take up much less natural space than landscapes.\nD) They come into people's view less often than natural spaces.",
      "block_bbox": [
        69,
        794,
        632,
        945
      ],
      "block_id": 7,
      "block_order": 8,
      "group_id": 7,
      "block_polygon_points": [
