    },
    {
      "block_label": "text",
      "block_content": "54. What does the example of sunset tell about nature?\nA) It creates a powerful appeal through its brilliant radiance.\nB) It displays aesthetic traits in a similar way the world over.\nC) It embodies beauty with a wide array of aesthetic features.\nD) It establishes the principles of beauty in a number of ways.",
      "block_bbox": [
        68,
